Skills: Observability

Purpose:
  Observability skills for logging, metrics, tracing, health, and incident management.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @logging.sdd
   3  @metrics.sdd
   4  @tracing.sdd
   5  @health.sdd
   6  @incident.sdd

Modes:
  LEARN    — learn observability fundamentals
  APPLY    — apply observability to system
  REVIEW   — review observability skills
  UPGRADE  — propose observability skill upgrade

Rules:
  [O1] Every service MUST have logs, metrics, and traces.
  [O2] Correlate telemetry with trace IDs.
  [O3] Monitor golden signals.
  [O4] Alerts MUST have runbooks.
  [O5] Health checks MUST be protected.
  [O6] Sensitive data MUST NOT appear in logs.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    logging.sdd

  Resolve:
    logging
    metrics
    tracing
    health
    incident

Navigation:
  Observability: @cross-cutting/observability/INDEX.sdd
  Logging: @cross-cutting/observability/logging.sdd
  Metrics: @cross-cutting/observability/metrics.sdd
  Tracing: @cross-cutting/observability/tracing.sdd
  Health: @cross-cutting/observability/health.sdd
  Incident: @cross-cutting/observability/incident.sdd

State: +
